## 1. Purpose and Scope

This document establishes the policy and procedures for the acquisition, management, and disposition of all commercial real estate leases for MedSync Health's global offices. The primary goal is to ensure all facilities provide a safe, productive, and compliant working environment that supports the company's strategic growth and operational efficiency.

This policy applies to all MedSync Health offices globally, including the corporate headquarters and all regional hubs. The Operations Department, led by the Chief Operating Officer (COO), is responsible for the execution and oversight of this policy.

